# Generated by pnpm, in pnpm's own format. Prettier reformats it into something
# pnpm did not write - roughly ten thousand changed lines on a nine thousand line
# file - so a one-line dependency change arrives as an unreviewable diff.
#
# lint-staged runs `prettier --write` over `*.{js,mjs,json,md,css,yml,yaml}`,
# which matches this file, so without this entry any commit that stages the
# lockfile rewrites all of it.
pnpm-lock.yaml
